### Listar directores
GET http://localhost:8080/api/directores
Accept: application/json

### Buscar director existente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/directores/1
Accept: application/json

### Buscar director inexistente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/directores/9999
Accept: application/json

### Crear director
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Directora HTTP",
  "nacionalidad": "España"
}

### Crear director duplicado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sacha Goedegebure",
  "nacionalidad": "Países Bajos"
}

### Crear director con nombre vacío
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "  ",
  "nacionalidad": "España"
}

### Actualizar director
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/directores/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Director HTTP Actualizado",
  "nacionalidad": "Chile"
}

### Actualizar director inexistente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/directores/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Director Inexistente",
  "nacionalidad": null
}

### Borrar director sin películas
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/directores/9

### Borrar director inexistente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/directores/9999